              is the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/obstruction"} obstruction
              to the existence of the extension/orientation at this stage.
            %p
              It follows that if these obstructions all vanish, then a quaternionic
              = succeed "-orientation" do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
